<title>USA: Reunion says reaches settlement with union.</title>
<headline>Reunion says reaches settlement with union.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reunion Industries Inc on Wednesday said workers at its Oneida Rostone Corp unit have ended their four-week strike and ratified a new three-year contract.</p>
<p>Terms of the contract at the Lafayette, Ind., facility were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Reunion manufactures plastic products and provides engineered plastic services.</p>
